{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-23","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与中项无理线段与线段","englishTitle":"A straight line commensurable with a medial straight line is medial.","book":10,"number":23,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.23","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.23/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":23,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-23@raw-e26383ef29759614","contentId":"euclid-10-23","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e26383ef29759614772b316494e91104db6128227a28abbb3a0f7735171bb869","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-23.statement","euclid-10-23.construction.1","euclid-10-23.construction.2","euclid-10-23.proof.1","euclid-10-23.proof.2","euclid-10-23.proof.3","euclid-10-23.proof.4","euclid-10-23.proof.5","euclid-10-23.proof.6","euclid-10-23.proof.7","euclid-10-23.proof.8","euclid-10-23.proof.9","euclid-10-23.proof.10","euclid-10-23.proof.11","euclid-10-23.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-23.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-23","revisionId":"euclid-10-23@raw-e26383ef29759614","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"605dc38b85d16531eafde4dee2cca47fc9d1ec85cf8a46809041528244b7d472","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"A straight line commensurable with a medial straight line is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"可公度线中项无理线段线中项无理线段线（相关点与线段：A）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-23.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-23","revisionId":"euclid-10-23@raw-e26383ef29759614","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"321f51f2588cbd7e71c40b8dbee9d47ccff3d833170372628df2b64525d6f4b7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A be medial, and let B be commensurable with A; I say that B is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A是中项无理线段,让B是可公度,A;我说B也是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-23.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-23","revisionId":"euclid-10-23@raw-e26383ef29759614","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1069731f0904f8c24db4a1894a1dbe74a67eda69542735d51fa3affa3002def0","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a rational straight line CD be set out, and to CD let the rectangular area CE equal to the square on A be applied, producing ED as breadth; therefore ED is rational and incommensurable in length with CD. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将有理线段 CD区域划为有理线段 CD区域,将A区域划为CE区域,宽度扩大ED区域;因此,ED区域划为有理和不可公度区域,长度为CD区域。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-23.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-23","revisionId":"euclid-10-23@raw-e26383ef29759614","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"10bd617150e42b4da90ffacb5a728da030e66015e33e80a0f1de3921bc198d06","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And let the rectangular area CF equal to the square on B be applied to CD, producing DF as breadth."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CF等量的长方形区域CF B 适用于CD,宽度DF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-23.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-23","revisionId":"euclid-10-23@raw-e26383ef29759614","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ad89d2cd6e2bdfb65dee41ba7f11b37fa2d13c8014561258b96b67656366469","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then A is commensurable with B, the square on A is also commensurable with the square on B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,A为可公度,B为可公度,A为可公度,正方形为B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-23.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-23","revisionId":"euclid-10-23@raw-e26383ef29759614","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1716c30503d75aff6cebc50eb957a150d80c0b0666a7abcb6b386f783727e32f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But EC is equal to the square on A, and CF is equal to the square on B; therefore EC is commensurable with CF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EC等于A,A,CF等于正方形,B;因此,EC等于可公度,CF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-23.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-23","revisionId":"euclid-10-23@raw-e26383ef29759614","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"68bd42f0d394870cab806fab4c7ca437d09e15518ad9db59798eb14c31deef99","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as EC is to CF, so is ED to DF; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore ED is commensurable in length with DF. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EC比CF等于ED比DF,因此ED比EC比DF；EC 与 CF 之比等于 ED 与 DF 之比；上述对应量可公度。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-23.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-23","revisionId":"euclid-10-23@raw-e26383ef29759614","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3442dc37bc7fce7a963dd95838bef9555c444b26cbc4493870ca80362104ba25","citations":["euclid-10-def-3","euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But ED is rational and incommensurable in length with DC; therefore DF is also rational [[X. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-3)] and incommensurable in length with DC. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ED是有理,不可公度是DC;因此,DF也是有理,不可公度是DC。 [[X. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-3)] [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-23.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-23","revisionId":"euclid-10-23@raw-e26383ef29759614","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"06a9c588301c857af9032351308057f76c23feefd3513e53bf2d22e1b3b43639","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore CD, DF are rational and commensurable in square only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CD、DF是有理和平方可公度而长度不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-23.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-23","revisionId":"euclid-10-23@raw-e26383ef29759614","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9d6d922e200790381a9697b00cac8e0bdf743d54853f501f620db8c57a6bac77","citations":["euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the straight line the square on which is equal to the rectangle contained by rational straight lines commensurable in square only is medial; [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)] therefore the side of the square equal to the rectangle CD, DF is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但正方形的直线等于有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度组成的矩形为中项无理线段;因此,正方形的边等于矩形 CD,DF是中项无理线段。 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-23.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-23","revisionId":"euclid-10-23@raw-e26383ef29759614","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"258a3d68f91755c0645a489f0152576572f194ddc1ca34c0d1ce33c73b49aa0f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And B is the side of the square equal to the rectangle CD, DF; therefore B is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B是正方形的一面 等于矩形 CD,DF, 因此B是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-23.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-23","revisionId":"euclid-10-23@raw-e26383ef29759614","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"57dff5eaaaaca746d077c1300f53e612c7afbaefec44ee29985de116d0dbd862","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Porism. From this it is manifest that an area commensurable with a medial area is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"推论 从中可以看出 可公度区中项无理线段区中项无理线段"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-23.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-23","revisionId":"euclid-10-23@raw-e26383ef29759614","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"688eab9734de2099752cad874acc0b913242699e3898040308190305aaa4529e","citations":["euclid-10-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"[And in the same way as was explained in the case of rationals [[Lemma following X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)] it follows, as regards medials, that a straight line commensurable in length with a medial straight line is called medial and commensurable with it not only in length but in square also, since, in general, straight lines commensurable in length are always commensurable in square also."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"按照讨论有理线段时所用的同样方法，对于中项无理线段也可以推出：如果一条线段与某条中项无理线段在长度上可公度，那么它也称为中项无理线段，并且不仅与该线段在长度上可公度，在平方上也可公度；因为一般而言，长度可公度的线段在平方上也总是可公度。 [[引理 following X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-23.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-23","revisionId":"euclid-10-23@raw-e26383ef29759614","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a5510e2d65131f1edc40f3080c80dc406875ec5131d52213706021dd3b3d3f0a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if any straight line be commensurable in square with a medial straight line, then, if it is also commensurable in length with it, the straight lines are called, in this case too, medial and commensurable in length and in square, but, if in square only, they are called medial straight lines commensurable in square only.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果正方形的直线为可公度,中项无理线段,那么,如果与长度可公度连线,则直线也称为中项无理线段和长度可公度,正方形,但仅正方形的直线则称为中项无理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度。 ]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-23.source","contentId":"euclid-10-23","revisionId":"euclid-10-23@raw-e26383ef29759614","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d5ae86e0885db9e30d166d417dbd14c54da54225817faa84b6bb0c080637b893","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.23/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.23\nCorpu